    "goal": "Co-seed HMEC-1 and PHH in a 12-well plate at 2.63e5 cells/cm² total across 0.72 cm² per well, with 0.765 of the total assigned to HMEC-1.",
    "rationale": "Co-culture seeding of an endothelial (HMEC-1, population A) and hepatocyte (PHH, population B) model in a 12-well plate. Total density 2.63e5 cells/cm² over 0.72 cm²/well gives ~189,360 cells/well; assigning 0.765 to HMEC-1 yields ~144,860 HMEC-1 and ~44,500 PHH per well, an A:B ratio of ~3.25. PHH are primary and non-proliferating, so the ratio will drift as HMEC-1 grows; the assay window must account for this. HMEC-1 is not in the physiology registry, so its seeding/physiological targets are unverified.",
